Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:01:00.76,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.98,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:08.69,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:11.98,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:15.19,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:20.91,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:27.06,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:31.56,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:34.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.00,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:45.37,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:50.62,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:54.44,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:04.39,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.09,0:01:00.76,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.98,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.98,0:01:08.69,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur0.75}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.14,0:01:11.98,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.98,0:01:15.19,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.19,0:01:20.91,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.91,0:01:27.06,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur0.75}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.29,0:01:31.56,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.56,0:01:34.23,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur0.75}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.00,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur0.75}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.76,0:01:45.37,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.37,0:01:50.62,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.77,0:01:54.44,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.75}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.94,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.94,0:02:04.39,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur0.75}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 2,0:25:44.38,0:25:50.00,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\t(0,428,1,\c&H96B9F7&)\blur0.75}Se o meu destino for virar cinzas e ossos
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.00,0:25:54.13,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H96B9F7&\t(3066,0,1,\c&H000000&)\blur0.75}Então quero cantar sobre felicidade e desespero
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.15,0:26:05.89,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,376,1,\c&H96B9F7&\3c&H0E1425&)\t(4964,6006,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)\t(6006,6423,\c&H6D5188&\3c&H0E1425&)\t(10678,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Enquanto ainda posso
Dialogue: 2,0:26:05.89,0:26:11.56,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,397,1,\c&HBB9238&\3c&H110700&)\t(4652,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Nosso destino para os dias que virão
Dialogue: 2,0:26:11.56,0:26:18.62,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(0,400,1,\c&H632355&\3c&H120405&)\blur0.75}É lutar a um passo da morte
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.62,0:26:26.90,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H632355&\3c&H120405&\t(2015,3016,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)\t(3048,3048,1,\c&HFEFBE5&\3c&H1A0602&)\blur0.75}Com sonhos em nossos corações
Dialogue: 2,0:26:26.91,0:26:31.12,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\fad(0,200)}Certa vez você chorou na noite
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.12,0:26:39.33,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}Mas um futuro melhor sempre foi possível para nós
Dialogue: 2,0:26:39.33,0:26:43.90,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}A quietude espera por você
